MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Own mistake from the 83 second pass: rewriting manifest.json after every 3 uploads (every upload in the final sync) tripped
GCS 429 rateLimitExceeded on the same object; objects landed, entries were re-uploaded next pass (churn, never loss), and the
deployment logged "degraded ... first manifest.json: OBJECT_PUT_FAILED" every two minutes. That change shipped without a test;
this one carries four (test/publish-fix-84-uploader.test.js).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
